"entity": {
"name": "Koninklijke Ahold Delhaize N.V.",
"description": "Koninklijke Ahold Delhaize NV engages in the management and operation of supermarkets and e-commerce business. It operates through the following segments: The U.S., Europe, and Other Retail. The U.S. segment includes Stop & Shop, Food Lion, Giant & Martin's, Hannaford, Giant Food and Peapod. The Europe segment is consisted of Albert Heijn, Etos, Gall & Gall, bol.com, Delhaize operations in Belgium and Luxembourg. The Other Retail segment handles the firm's joint ventures.The company was founded in 1867 and is headquartered in Zaandam, the Netherlands.",
